{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragtag Heroes is a co-op roguelike deckbuilder for up to 3 players. The realm's champion has been defeated. Now it's up to a team of ragtag heroes to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally your party from a growing roster of diverse heroes, craft powerful decks, and control the flow of battle as you face corrupted worlds that change every run! With new synergies, challenges, and surprises each time, no two adventures are ever alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALTERNATE ACTS &amp; CORRUPTED WORLDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/9c6540793d39bddb2421ea9348fe5d0f.poster.avif?t=1770831788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/9c6540793d39bddb2421ea9348fe5d0f.webm?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/9c6540793d39bddb2421ea9348fe5d0f.mp4?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys are the same. Each run randomizes the order of worlds, so one adventure might begin in the Forest while the next throws you straight into the Desert. Furthermore: The deeper you go, the more each world becomes twisted by Madrok\u2019s growing corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even better: there are more worlds than acts in a single run. You\u2019ll never see everything at once - and every playthrough offers new challenges, enemies, and surprises waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROL THE BATTLEFIELD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.poster.avif?t=1770831788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.webm?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.mp4?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push attacking monsters away from weakened heroes and bring your melee attackers in close range to deliver deadly blows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock monsters in place or punish them for moving around - but watch out as they might do the same to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE SYNERGIES ACROSS DECKS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.poster.avif?t=1770831788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.webm?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.mp4?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has their own strengths and weaknesses and allows for a variety of strategies in building their deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They also synergize differently with other heroes from the roster - so by switching team mates you can explore different team tactics each run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROL THE TURNORDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.poster.avif?t=1770831788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.webm?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/60b9f4d15a1e66bdce189fdecf632e79.mp4?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initiative determines the order of turns in combat. Strategically lowering your opponents' initiative allows your heroes to act sooner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may even concentrate your efforts on reducing one enemy's initiative to zero to stun them, forcing them to skip a turn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR ENERGY GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.poster.avif?t=1770831788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.webm?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/daeb611d10d5982f11a45b104f38a60e.mp4?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave and Default add an extra layer to your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBrave\u201d will grant you more energy (action points) for your current turn, but you will become stunned and will have to pass the next one.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or &quot;Default&quot; your turn without performing any actions and you'll increase your hero\u2019s energy (action points) by 1 for the remaining battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAUNCH CONTENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7+ heroes with their own set of cards and relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500+ different cards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 100+ items to be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ different worlds you encounter in different stages of corruption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ unique combat encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ mysterious story encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > co-op multiplayer both locally and online with up to 3 players</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2067070?t=1770831788","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/3ab389cc6cfdd587ea39ffe04341e354ad0b2ef2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770831788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/1e29f8b5d60b2116160ece1f16ef1b40660d3618/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770831788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/1e29f8b5d60b2116160ece1f16ef1b40660d3618/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770831788","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"