 autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.poster.avif?t=1770831788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.webm?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/ec269e8e0e8c5fb2c4364d4c3b0d10c5.mp4?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push attacking monsters away from weakened heroes and bring your melee attackers in close range to deliver deadly blows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lock monsters in place or punish them for moving around - but watch out as they might do the same to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE SYNERGIES ACROSS DECKS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.poster.avif?t=1770831788\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.webm?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/extras/46cddf4d7f6b1ab72830e0f60e5b8f82.mp4?t=1770831788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has their own strengths and weaknesses and allows for a variety of strategies in building their deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They also synergize differently with other heroes from the roster - so by switching team mates you can explore different team tactics each run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><