 become stunned and will have to pass the next one.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or &quot;Default&quot; your turn without performing any actions and you'll increase your hero\u2019s energy (action points) by 1 for the remaining battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LAUNCH CONTENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 7+ heroes with their own set of cards and relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >500+ different cards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 100+ items to be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4+ different worlds you encounter in different stages of corruption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ unique combat encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ mysterious story encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > co-op multiplayer both locally and online with up to 3 players</p></li></ul>","developers":["fad","Ragtag Heroes Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2067070/e75a32628822443df366702026f16e0d15367fb5/header.jpg?t=1770831788","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.10.5 Yosemite or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 750M (1024 MB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","re